SUMMARY:Deadline: Alberta Foundation for the Arts: Visual Arts and New Medi
 a Individual Project Funding (March 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Project grants for individual artists in visual arts and new me
 dia (new media explicitly included)\, covering creation\, development\, tr
 aining and marketing. A parallel AFA Film and Video Individual Project Fun
 ding stream shares the same deadline and the same CAD 18\,000 cap.\n\nOrga
 nisation: Alberta Foundation for the Arts\nLocation: Alberta\, Canada. RES
 TRICTED: Canadian citizens\, permanent residents or Protected Persons with
  primary residence in Alberta for at least one full year before applying.\
 nAward: Up to CAD 18\,000 per project. No application fee.\nDuration: Per 
 project\n\nMore: https://affta.ab.ca/funding/find-funding/visual-arts-and-
 new-media-individual-project-funding?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
 &utm_medium=referral
URL:https://affta.ab.ca/funding/find-funding/visual-arts-and-new-media-indi
 vidual-project-funding?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
LOCATION:Alberta\, Canada. RESTRICTED: Canadian citizens\, permanent reside
 nts or Protected Persons with primary residence in Alberta for at least on
 e full year before applying.
END:VEVENT
