SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 PST: Indigenous Screen Office: Production Program fo
 r All 2026 (up to CAD 75\,000 for individuals)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 25 Nov 2026 at 17:00 PST.\n\nThe Indigenous Screen Offic
 e's Production Program for All funds Indigenous-led screen production: sho
 rts\, features\, series and pilots\, including animation.\n\nOrganisation:
  Indigenous Screen Office (ISO-BEA)\nLocation: Canada. RESTRICTED: First N
 ations\, Inuit or Metis creators who are Canadian citizens or permanent re
 sidents living in Canada.\nAward: Up to CAD 75\,000 for individuals\, coll
 ectives or community groups\; Indigenous-owned companies can apply for CAD
  150\,000 up to CAD 500\,000-750\,000 depending on project type and budget
 . No application fee stated.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: https://iso-b
 ea.ca/funding-opportunities/production-program-for-all-2026/?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://iso-bea.ca/funding-opportunities/production-program-for-all-202
 6/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Canada. RESTRICTED: First Nations\, Inuit or Metis creators who ar
 e Canadian citizens or permanent residents living in Canada.
